ICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjnm9PdtNeWAxWuia8BHcRHFRcQ3YcHCIMCKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjnm9PdtNeWAxWuia8BHcRHFRcQ3IcHCIICKBU",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["住在這邊三年多，每次路過因外頭無法直接看到裡面，都以為是居酒屋或是高級日料，遲遲不敢入內用餐。\n昨天很想吃拉麵，查了一下附近店家居然跳出百壽爺，才知道你們是拉麵店😂\n下班馬上至貴店用餐～\n\n女生服務人員的態度非常好👍🏼\n店內有棵假櫻花樹🌸和一些裝飾燈籠🏮以及櫃檯拉麵的布簾整體很有日式氣氛的佈置。\n店裡訊號很差，需掃碼點餐，有提供Wifi使用，但wifi名稱似乎還沒更新。\n\n胡麻龍鬚菜吃起來是辣胡麻🌶️很特別的味道，很上癮，會讓人想再吃！只是辣味建議做標示，怕有些人不吃辣或是小朋友吃到，不符期望。\n\n拉麵的湯頭及口感我覺得都不錯，但是叉燒部分太少了，圖片上特濃4片、醬油2片，實際上特濃2片、醬油1片，而且肉也碎碎的，肉質與份量我覺得可以再用心挑選一點。\n因為朋友點醬油他只有1片肉，他直接表示不會再訪，但我覺得如有增量其實整體滿好吃的～\n\n因為我是不喜歡吃溏心蛋的，但你們家的溏心蛋，蛋黃的部分很綿密很鬆軟！口感我很喜歡！但我確定這不是原本溏心蛋應該要有的樣子🤣\n\n拉麵可以再續一球或半球，一定吃的飽👍🏼\n可樂餅表現中規中矩，一個$50、兩個$95，口味非常多！\n叉燒飯已售完，如有機會會想再嘗試～",null,[0,93]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18135804460566326917/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjZjVTVITm1SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18135804460566326917/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjZjVTVITm1SUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18135804460566326917/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjZjVTVITm1SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18135804460566326917/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjZjVTVITm1SUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18135804460566326917/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjZjVTVITm1SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18135804460566326917/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTjZjVTVITm1SUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,9881,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN6cU5HNmRREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x45320bb8562ee835!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICzqNG6dQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0Fn